# 🌟 Conclusion

**Netflix Analytics Hub** demonstrates how raw entertainment data can be transformed into an interactive **Business Intelligence solution using Power BI**.

By combining **data preparation, data modeling, DAX, visualization, and analytical storytelling**, the dashboard provides a comprehensive view of Netflix's content ecosystem across **content, countries, genres, ratings, and cast & crew**.

